# VFX-15 VFX Paint mode, Painted Set brush (UE ArrayPosition DI + a shape-location module; the brush is the ported
# Foliage brush): Campfire's Flames are made to spawn from PointSet.PaintedPoints (engine:ShapePointSet, the
# sphere shape disabled), then two strokes paint the Campfire placement's set onto the ground; one stroke = one
# undo step; the set is saved in the scene (VFXComponentData::PointSets) and reopens identical.
# The order differs from the brief: the .dfx edit comes FIRST so that Undo after the strokes takes the second
# stroke, not the document edit (a reopen starts a fresh history, so Undo is played before the save, then Redo).
# The scene is opened FIRST: the .dfx save restarts the placement and dirties the scene, and opening it then
# raises the modal "Open Scene?" that swallowed every drag (pass 3). Point markers are ImGui overlay, so the
# frames that must show them are whole-window `Тогда`, not viewport-only `Тогда-вид`.
# Drag coordinates are viewport POINTS; the viewport is ~1431x857 pt and its `Тогда-вид` shot is 1435x857 px, so
# a shot pixel IS a drag point. Pass 3's first stroke started at (120,200), under the VFX Paint panel, and was
# rightly taken by the panel, not painted.
# The scenario SAVES: `git checkout -- Projects/Desert/Content/Scenes/Starter.desce Projects/Desert/Content/VFX/Campfire.dfx` after a play.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run Open "VFX/Campfire.dfx"
Дано run Document "Campfire.dfx: Spawn Flames from point set PaintedPoints"
Дано run Document "Save this document"
Дано run Document "Close Campfire.dfx"
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Campfire"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 300,650,-300
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.72,0.69
Дано run VFX "VFX Paint mode"
Дано run VFX "VFX Paint: radius 100 cm"
Дано run VFX "VFX Paint: density high"
Когда --subject viewport drag 350,260 800,260 30
Когда --subject viewport drag 150,560 600,780 30
Когда state
Тогда 0_points blue painted point markers along two strokes on the ground (a straight one above, a slanted one below), flames rising from them
Когда run Foliage "Foliage mode"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 1_spawn after 1 s more the flames rise from the two painted strokes, none from the campfire origin (300, 0, 250)
Когда run VFX "VFX Paint mode"
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда state
Тогда 3_undo only the first (upper, straight) stroke's points remain, flames only along it
Когда run Action "Redo"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Campfire"
Когда run VFX "VFX Paint mode"
Когда state
Тогда 2_reopen the same two strokes of points and the same flames as 0_points after the saved scene is reopened
